{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "716620ac483168bf501f44315acdd821b16fc5b2a52bc5a3466a01467045491f", "ja": "私たちはずっと…", "zh": "我们一直都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e59efaa88caaeceecc4c913b93b6483ff894f407bbd3ab157230ad48113d9cd8", "ja": "初ライブを終えた『FleurS』。その後の\n活動を通して三人が絆を深めていく中、\n桃子にはずっと胸に秘めていた想いが\nあった。意を決して「演技がしたい」と\n伝えるが、百合子はあっさり同意する。", "zh": "结束了首次演出的『FleurS』。在之后的活动中，三人逐渐加深羁绊，而桃子一直把一个想法藏在心里。她终于下定决心，说出“我想演戏”，百合子却爽快地表示赞同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1000_049mom", "source_sha256": "524dade38ad37ec70482c6a81b86bf9cd0f8fa6b308c4e62e8be3896885ef3f8", "ja": "それからも、桃子たちはたくさんお話ししたんだ。\nクリスマスにはプレゼントもあげたりね。", "zh": "从那以后，桃子她们也聊了很多呢。\n圣诞节的时候，还互相送了礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "ce99fc6e3beacca58fc66e4765ce9c8569408adcabf9217aefd76e127265d328", "ja": "FleurSはどんどん桃子の大切な場所になって……\nだから、なかなか言えなかった。", "zh": "FleurS渐渐成了对桃子来说很重要的地方……\n所以，桃子一直说不出口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "856aac592d8025e0cdd751b2968ac413b806e1b3d71560970200e2d5ad2a0476", "ja": "桃子がしたいことは、ふたりとは少し違うって。\nでもふたりに隠し事するのは、もっとイヤだから……！", "zh": "桃子想做的事，和你们两个稍微有些不同。\n但是，比起对你们两个有所隐瞒，桃子更不愿意那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "56fb6f7b485cf498caab94b24a5790591e5606e0df8c52d8be41c6eb072982f6", "ja": "演技のお仕事がしたい？", "zh": "你想接演戏的工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "59deefe6cadab44f84d7f6ef20225a2684b55cd73238efc7a0f7edf4532f1a63", "ja": "この前の天体公演の静香さんを見て……\n昔のお仕事のこと思い出しちゃったんだ。", "zh": "看到之前天体公演上的静香姐姐……  \n我不禁想起了以前工作的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "af048e4a1d92974324528ea05ed8de9b6961c0bd7e35a4f8508f30ed73ff9e0d", "ja": "それで最近、お芝居のこと考えて、\nちょっとボーっとしちゃってたの。", "zh": "所以最近一直在想演戏的事，稍微有点走神了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "7d7c291be385cf1ffd73877a702af042367288c198ac248854df42689febedac", "ja": "心配かけちゃったかもだから、\n一応言っておいたほうがいいかなって。", "zh": "可能会让你担心了，\n所以我想还是先跟你说一声比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "0016683cd7ef8234b7b4f617f331bd3ae7d55c33cde002611bd6566e3e134f11", "ja": "そ、そうだったんだ……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "538c9bff88d2c38d2fbd1ccbcadd540c63768dc475493e58ceb97575bf073d87", "ja": "……そ、それなら桃子ちゃんは……\nこれから……どうしたい……？", "zh": "……那、那样的话，桃子……接下来……想怎么办……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "70d637c9b958161347c77da533058c828d68c75007baebd3da67f300d4bc1b08", "ja": "……。\nそ、そんなの決まってるでしょ。", "zh": "……。\n那、那还用说嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "5d4f808a5aafed74d054b1b650630d8a07fc3984cbba97fce6fbf08d0b2f50af", "ja": "アイドルとして三人でトップになるんだから……\nそれが今の桃子の一番の夢だもん。", "zh": "作为偶像，我们三个人要一起登上顶峰……\n这就是桃子现在最大的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "8fad6939ff2de653b5afc837bd2b2fd0bf0f4c1497bc95f4390661321b36ccdf", "ja": "だから、桃子はこれまで通り……", "zh": "所以，桃子会一如既往地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "a9c8132c1f478ed162a3c5b3a49f7b1c60faba1a109d9508540927a6f19b8d25", "ja": "いやいや桃子ちゃん。\nそれなら演技のお仕事やったほうがいいよ！", "zh": "不不不，桃子。\n既然这样，还是去接演戏的工作比较好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "e4376007066b850c03ffdac747c7a1f5757f3b007163bf5b66f4e242f73aa45b", "ja": "ゆ、百合子さん！？　最後まで聞いて……！\n桃子はなにも変えなくていいって……。", "zh": "百、百合子小姐！？请听我说完……！\n说桃子什么都不用改变……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "5a97ed08c8f8546969463b6ee0c39d3099e32a57927df3f644a53e4135709227", "ja": "うう……ごめんなさい。私が力不足だから、\nそう言わせちゃって。で、でも私頑張るから！", "zh": "呜呜……对不起。都是因为我不够优秀，\n才让你说出这种话。但、但我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "6eddae500ba80ded0897e026202f21f8c68040781e2860d39daab10123e63022", "ja": "だから桃子ちゃん。\n私たちに演技の極意を伝授して！", "zh": "所以说，桃子！\n把演戏的秘诀传授给我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "c7e9494d05da9f7c881cdf330de5cd0e4c0f53cf76242e6b671a72c666af4242", "ja": "そう、ちょうど私もね！　お芝居に興味あったんだ。\n感情を込めて台詞を言うの元々すきだったし……。", "zh": "对，我正好也对演戏感兴趣呢！  \n我本来就喜欢带着感情念台词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "30907d33bb3a6375b13eb8a104e78f752c8099304297846359a61cd6e796b719", "ja": "物語を表現するには、\n歌やダンスだけじゃ足りないもんねっ。", "zh": "要表现故事，\n光靠唱歌和跳舞可不够呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "ca5df24ee25cc7ba84a3c0ff5c9e37f8e37f88071239e6a22be11b2f9f7dbd4b", "ja": "ゆ、百合子ちゃん？\n今の話はどういうことだと……？", "zh": "百、百合子？\n你刚才那番话是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "1b569a5adfad5a136a0bf4450f20c81698017f2b0e77e08d8228f6b423591f4a", "ja": "へ？　どういうって……\n演技のお仕事がしたいってことはつまり……。", "zh": "诶？你说什么意思……想做演戏的工作，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "b6e1867cfc2734c208f3254a2b379d795c132b6087d80af7ddc08759c10231e1", "ja": "本当は早くFleurSでドラマとかやりたいと\n思ってるんだぞ……という話では……？　あ、あれ？", "zh": "其实是想早点和FleurS一起出演电视剧之类的……应该是这个意思吧……？啊、咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "3663fcec887a973e656e8e5e09399fd5275904c925b5753b3e33e687acd3102c", "ja": "正解！\n今……FleurSの新たな目標が決まったわ。", "zh": "答对了！\n现在……FleurS的新目标已经决定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "4379b682fd000310c487def4881ac0d002094967069e17b643b7e9c198d7aaf6", "ja": "目指すは木9！　巷で噂のドラマのゴールデンタイム\n……木曜9時枠に三人そろってドラマの主演よ！", "zh": "目标是周四9！登上街头热议电视剧的黄金时段……\n三个人一起主演周四9点档的电视剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "c814ddf588b9b7be3b68ebd9f6cf257c041fe4b40d905bb1907b64995ac5e03d", "ja": "トップアイドルになるなら、\nそれくらいやってみせないとね！", "zh": "要成为顶级偶像，就得做到这种程度才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "0eb866f4303005a32109fc8959bcffc8cb375863129ee6841042d48daf9e47df", "ja": "も……木9……！　ゴールデン……！\nこのみさん、また大それた目標を……。", "zh": "不……木9……！黄金……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "3e4bff4c34658744e36cffadbcdc0a0c2e7c882cdcfaada38c87abd4a7c1f033", "ja": "大丈夫よ♪　私たちには心強い師匠がいるもの！\nねっ！", "zh": "没事的♪ 因为我们身边还有位令人安心的师父在嘛！\n对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "d99ec15319d7c09f4e220a6eb239fa5d8ff683166aa4bcd7838cffb72387f599", "ja": "百合子さん……このみさん……。", "zh": "百合子姐姐……木实姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "68628d74f039457010f837960d48e4832f3485baf955acf13d37ad6308e6f3fa", "ja": "……桃子ちゃん、忘れないでね。\nあなたの夢がこれからどんな形になっても。", "zh": "……桃子，可别忘了哦。\n无论你的梦想今后会变成什么形状。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3237ffbb0763016dbe50339cd91ce2d63c98694d06e6993fd3734e412b84fb3", "ja": "私たちはずっと……いっしょよ。", "zh": "我们会一直……在一起的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "a6f55507b7242a8d9a0aa92faaac45e361d1ef6a6ec8c96283d7d2e31a6a129f", "ja": "うん……！", "zh": "嗯……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "ec8320e8609b36f9c8b0b4daad0f0ec0af424f129a96ca56965bcaf228f0cc9d", "ja": "（桃子は……やっぱりばかな子だったのかもしれない）", "zh": "（桃子……果然可能是个笨孩子）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "25ffe72c3f7ee3eefd22727213b77952f177b20b469736c2f114e48b8bf80777", "ja": "（桃子の夢に付き合ってほしい……\nそんな簡単なことがどうして言えなかったんだろう）", "zh": "（希望你能陪桃子一起实现梦想……\n这么简单的话，为什么就是说不出口呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "fc7d1322d975f2baee9f1e92d5b33e2ba6fad545151c2d1e32ae91f18dcca333", "ja": "（三人で同じドラマに出演……その夢が叶ったら……\n今度こそちゃんと伝えるんだ）", "zh": "（三个人出演同一部电视剧……如果那个梦想实现了……这次一定要好好说出来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_03_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "26865aac1e9bd41ec118201d2dbe0647be97bfd5e5edd60bfe4b13e963a8b07c", "ja": "（「大好き」って……！）", "zh": "（把“最喜欢你”……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
